From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] mmdevapi: Spatial audio objects, volume, services and availability.

Spatial audio object streams end objects at end of stream and drop
inactive ones after each pass, SetPosition on static objects fails with
SPTLAUDCLNT_E_PROPERTY_NOT_SUPPORTED, SetVolume works, GetService gives the
clock and volume, Reset is implemented, the format check ignores
nBlockAlign, static object positions and the native mask follow the mix
format, IsSpatialAudioStreamAvailable answers and unsupported stream IIDs
give SPTLAUDCLNT_E_STREAM_NOT_AVAILABLE. Unknown client flags are a WARN.
Removes eleven todo_wine marks of the spatialaudio test.
