 dlls/mmdevapi/spatialaudio.c       | 283 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 dlls/mmdevapi/tests/spatialaudio.c |  14 +-
 3 files changed, 263 insertions(+), 37 deletions(-)

